Semtag injection complete for the CuratedPicks app (`web_applications_hinted/WebTestBench_0001`). 75 hinted elements, validator clean (0 errors / 0 warnings), `tsc --noEmit` clean, `vite build` succeeds.

## Screens & components annotated
- **Header/Footer (all screens):** logo, 5 nav links (+ `.mobile` copies with identical `data-semtag-state`), desktop/mobile search (`search.query` / `search.query.mobile`, shared state `search.query`), admin link, mobile-menu toggle (`open`/`closed`), footer links under a separate `footer.*` namespace to stay unique page-wide.
- **Home (`Index`):** hero CTAs, `home.featured` collection, `home.categories` collection (with per-item product counts), per-category `home.latest.<cat>` collections, view-all links.
- **Products / Category pages:** result count observable, `products.grid` / `category.grid` collections, full filter bar — search, category & sort selects with `data-semtag-options` built from the same arrays that render their `SelectItem`s, advanced panel region + open/closed toggle, price slider with min/max observables, `filters.tags` toggle collection, clear button. `data-semtag-controls` is threaded per page so filters point at the right grid.
- **Product detail:** back link, name/price/rating/description/review observables, buy action, `product.tags` and `product.specs` collections, `product.related` collection, not-found branch.
- **Admin:** add-product action, `admin.form` region with all 9 fields + category select (options from `categories`), featured switch, submit/cancel, `admin.products` collection keyed by product id with per-item price, rating, `.edit` (controls `admin.form`) and `.delete`.
- **404 page:** return-home link.

## Id namespaces
`nav.*`, `search.*`, `footer.*`, `home.*`, `products.*`, `category.*`, `filters.*`, `product.*`, `admin.*`, `notfound.*`

## Code changes beyond attributes (all permitted prop-threading, no behavior change)
- `RatingStars` widened with `React.ComponentProps<'div'>` + spread, so detail/admin pages can mark it observable.
- Optional props threaded: `ProductCard.semtagCollection`, `ProductGrid.semtagId`, `ProductFilters.semtagControls` — each emits **no** attributes when absent, per spec §8.
- Filter select options lifted into shared `categoryOptions`/`sortOptions`/`ratingOptions` consts so triggers and menus can't drift (renders identical output).

## Deliberate gaps
- **Admin spec rows not folded/hinted:** rows are user-entered label/value pairs with no stable domain key (blank on creation), so any id would be index-keyed, which the spec forbids. Only the "Add Spec" button is hinted.
- `product.specs` items are keyed by slugified spec label — unique for all shipped data; two identical labels on one product would collide (noting since the linter can't see runtime values).
- Left unhinted: card image links (duplicate the title link), decorative icons, hero copy, category badges, and the footer copyright line.

